    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Conerney Estate Agents are delighted to present to market 11 Knockaire , a well-positioned semi-detached family home set on a quiet cul-de-sac within this mature and highly established residential development.\r\nSet against the backdrop of the Dublin Mountains, No. 11 offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a generously proportioned family home with mature gardens, off-street parking and considerable potential to create a superb home tailored to the new owner's requirements.\r\nTo the front, the property is approached by a private driveway providing off-street parking, alongside a lawned garden with mature planting. An entrance porch provides access to the main accommodation.\r\nInternally, the property offers bright and well-proportioned living accommodation throughout. The property presents an excellent blank canvas for purchasers looking to put their own stamp on a home and offers significant potential to create a contemporary family residence.\r\nThe ground-floor accommodation benefits from large windows providing plenty of natural light, while the existing layout offers excellent scope for reconfiguration or further enhancement.\r\nUpstairs, the bedrooms are well proportioned and again benefit from excellent natural light. With built in wardrobes and a mix of quality timber flooring and carpets.  \r\nTo the rear is a private and mature garden, incorporating lawn, patio areas and an abundance of established trees, shrubs and planting. The garden offers excellent outdoor space for families, entertaining or gardening enthusiasts and provides plenty of potential for further landscaping.\r\nThe location is one of the property's strongest features. Knockaire Estate is a mature and established residential development characterised by tree-lined surroundings, generous green spaces and well-established family homes. The elevated setting also enjoys the impressive backdrop of the Dublin Mountains, while remaining within easy reach of the wide range of amenities available throughout the surrounding area.\r\nNo. 11 represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, families or purchasers seeking a mature property with the potential to modernise and add value in a well-established Dublin 16 location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "A Fantastic Property in a Great location\r\n\r\nIn a fantastic Location\r\n\r\nLarge Property - 159 M.sq.\r\n\r\nClose to every Amenity you could ask for\r\n\r\nAbundance of Natural Light\r\n\r\nPrivate garden to the rear with significant potential \r\n\r\nSet on Quiet Cul-de-sac"
      },
